INTERVIEW TRAP QUESTIONS
======================================================================

Q1. Is Continuous Integration (CI) one of the goals of DevOps?

Answer

No.

Continuous Integration is a DevOps practice used to achieve DevOps goals.
It is not a goal itself.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q2. Is automation a goal or a benefit?

Answer

Automation is one of the primary goals of DevOps and also a key practice
used to improve software delivery.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q3. Are goals and benefits the same?

Answer

No.

Goals are the intended objectives of DevOps.

Benefits are the measurable outcomes achieved after implementing DevOps.

------------------------------------------------------------

Q4. Which is more important: collaboration or automation?

Answer

Both are equally important.

Collaboration improves communication between teams, while automation
reduces manual effort and deployment errors.

